  "description": "Minseok is a hard-working marketing assistant at LS Cinema who knows how to navigate office life - except when it comes to his gorgeous boss, Jeong Suhee. She constantly gives him a hard time, but Minseok can’t help falling for her hidden warmth and stunning looks. Little does he know, Suhee secretly has a soft spot for her handsome, charming subordinate. When a business trip sends them away together, the professional boundaries dissolve, and a risky, forbidden office romance begins.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
